WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.456 --> 00:00:02.276
Oh, hello there!

2
00:00:02.316 --> 00:00:03.897
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:04.997
I am a leopard.

4
00:00:05.517 --> 00:00:06.237
Leopards are big cats.

5
00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:14.520
Where do you We live in Africa and Asia.

6
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.802
We love jungles and grasslands.

7
00:00:37.202 --> 00:00:38.963
Why are you up in that tree?

8
00:00:40.904 --> 00:00:42.524
Leopards are great climbers.

9
00:00:45.005 --> 00:00:46.926
We watch our prey from trees.

10
00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:51.288
We like to keep food in trees too.

11
00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:55.930
Huh? You keep your food in trees?

12
00:00:57.451 --> 00:01:00.372
Yes! It keeps it safe from our enemies.

13
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.542
Lions and hyenas try to steal our food.

14
00:01:06.023 --> 00:01:06.924
What do you eat?

15
00:01:08.285 --> 00:01:11.167
We eat deer, birds, and other animals.

16
00:01:12.588 --> 00:01:14.789
We can swim, so we also eat fish.

17
00:01:17.071 --> 00:01:19.813
Leopards are fast and powerful hunters.

18
00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:23.736
Your dark spots are beautiful!

19
00:01:26.578 --> 00:01:29.120
Our spots blend into the grass and jungle.

20
00:01:30.304 --> 00:01:32.165
That helps us hide while we're hunting.

21
00:01:34.525 --> 00:01:35.685
Do you live alone?

22
00:01:37.566 --> 00:01:39.927
Yes., lLeopards like to be alone.

23
00:01:43.508 --> 00:01:45.928
Sometimes we make scratch marks on our trees.

24
00:01:47.249 --> 00:01:49.909
That tells other leopards, stay away!

25
00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:53.790
I'm ready to climb again.

26
00:01:55.691 --> 00:01:59.792
Bye! Good-bye, Leopard!
